{"id":"punta","lemma":"punta","pos":"noun","rank":1978,"glosses":["tip, point, end","pinch, bit (small amount)"],"ipa":"/ˈpunta/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"puntas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/84/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-punta.wav","examples":[{"text":"Me puso los pelos de punta.","en":"It gave me goosebumps.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/302018"},{"text":"Tengo las puntas abiertas.","en":"I have split ends.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/518648"},{"text":"Hay que sacarles punta a estos lápices.","en":"These pencils need sharpening.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/642145"},{"text":"Quiero cortarme las puntas.","en":"I'd like my hair trimmed.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/801357"},{"text":"Me gustan los bolígrafos con punta fina.","en":"I like a pen with a fine point.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/645649"}]}